# Guitar Freaks 3rd Mix (GE949 VER. JAB), Konami 2000: the first power-on, from blank NVRAM, with
# the game cassette in; no inputs. Hashes the main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60 frames,
# to compare with MAME.
game gtfrk3ma

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

from 0 every 60 snap
at 6000 quit
